# T_SCRE: a level-2 user starting on the serial number field: the result
# opened for editing, a negative quantity refused by the form's own
# check, then corrected and saved.
S SERSTART
T SN-0111
K CTRL-S
S OPERRES
K CTRL-E PGUP DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN CTRL-Y
T -2
K CTRL-S
S NEGQTY
K CTRL-Y
T 5
K CTRL-S
S OPSAVED
K ESC ESC
